  "description": "An advanced audio library, written in C#. Provides tons of features. From playing/recording audio to decoding/encoding audio streams/files to processing audio data in realtime (e.g. applying custom effects during playback, create visualizations,...). The possibilities are nearly unlimited. ",
  "description_ja": "C#で書かれた高度な音声ライブラリ。音声の再生/録音からストリーム/ファイルのデコード/エンコード、リアルタイム音声処理（再生中のカスタムエフェクト適用・可視化など）まで豊富な機能を提供。可能性はほぼ無限大",
